      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bL3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 230528621,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 342956419,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782406060097,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "After the definition of `w`, only the outer call to `id` has been executed, so `count` is 1.\nThe inner call `(id 10)` is delayed as a thunk. Evaluating `w` forces this thunk, causing the\ninner call to `id` to execute, incrementing `count` to 2 and returning 10. Hence, the final\nvalue of `count` is 2.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After the definition of `w`, only the outer call to `id` has been executed, so `count` is 1.\nThe inner call `(id 10)` is delayed as a thunk. Evaluating `w` forces this thunk, causing the\ninner call to `id` to execute, incrementing `count` to 2 and returning 10. Hence, the final\nvalue of `count` is 2.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
